From: Chromium-HaikuOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] build: add the Haiku platform (build flags, toolchain, Ozone/Wayland defaults)

Applies after the FreeBSD 156.0.8078.79 patches and tools/haikuify.py.
---
diff --git a/base/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/build_config.h b/base/allocator/partition_allocator/src/partition_alloc/build_config.h
